  <ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock id="f-9" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Orange and Rockland Utilities, Inc., One Blue Hill Plaza, Pearl River, New York through 100% ownership of Company Stock. Respondent has been operated and controlled by Orange and Rockland Utilities, Inc. since its organization December 27, 1899, control through common stock ownership having been established December 15, 1901.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
