  <ferc:OrderNumber id="f-773" contextRef="c-165" decimals="INF" unitRef="u-1">31</ferc:OrderNumber>
  <ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription id="f-774" contextRef="c-166">Federal Income Tax</ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription>
  <ferc:OrderNumber id="f-775" contextRef="c-166" decimals="INF" unitRef="u-1">32</ferc:OrderNumber>
  <ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription id="f-776" contextRef="c-167">Basis of Allocation:</ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription>
  <ferc:OrderNumber id="f-777" contextRef="c-167" decimals="INF" unitRef="u-1">34</ferc:OrderNumber>
  <ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription id="f-778" contextRef="c-168">The Company, along with Con Edison and its other subsidiaries, files a consolidated federal income tax return. The</ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription>
  <ferc:OrderNumber id="f-779" contextRef="c-168" decimals="INF" unitRef="u-1">36</ferc:OrderNumber>
  <ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription id="f-780" contextRef="c-169">consolidated income tax liability is allocated to each member of the consolidated group using the separate return</ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription>
  <ferc:OrderNumber id="f-781" contextRef="c-169" decimals="INF" unitRef="u-1">37</ferc:OrderNumber>
  <ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription id="f-782" contextRef="c-170">method. Each member pays or receives an amount based on its own taxable income or loss in accordance with a</ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription>
  <ferc:OrderNumber id="f-783" contextRef="c-170" decimals="INF" unitRef="u-1">38</ferc:OrderNumber>
  <ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription id="f-784" contextRef="c-171">consolidated tax allocation agreement. Tax loss and tax credit carryforwards, as well as the corporate alternative</ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription>
  <ferc:OrderNumber id="f-785" contextRef="c-171" decimals="INF" unitRef="u-1">39</ferc:OrderNumber>
  <ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription id="f-786" contextRef="c-172">minimum tax (CAMT) liability, are allocated among members in accordance with consolidated tax return regulations.</ferc:ComputationOfTaxDescription>
  <ferc:OrderNumber id="f-787" contextRef="c-172" decimals="INF" unitRef="u-1">40</ferc:OrderNumber>
  <ferc:ComputationOfTax id="f-788" contextRef="c-163" decimals="0" unitRef="u-2">390753</ferc:ComputationOfTax>
